# Large trained models (>50MB each, easily reproducible via `python main.py train`)
# GitHub warns at 50MB and hard-blocks at 100MB without Git LFS.
# These models can be regenerated anytime by running: python main.py train
models/*.joblib
!models/.gitkeep
